Tool: archive_board
Description: Archives the board with the specified ID by setting its is_archived flag to 1.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "board_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Board Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
